"613301251","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["军长的嘴唇紧紧抿在一起，艰难蠕动着，仿佛是在咀嚼一块铁片。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["他俯身，从一堆文件中抽出一张已经揉皱了的信纸，递过桌面。斯捷尔诺娃疑惑地皱着眉，接了过去。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["斯捷尔诺娃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529812.png","audio":"613301252","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“伊万：伊里内伊的人做到了，芝诺的结局无可避免。我附信来只是想以私人身份给予你一些提醒。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["斯捷尔诺娃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529812.png","audio":"613301253","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“联合委员会正在加紧对芝诺军队的控制，每位外派的将领身边，都必须要有一位基金会信得过的联络人。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["斯捷尔诺娃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529812.png","audio":"613301254","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“你曾是伊戈尔最信赖的下属，原本光凭这一条，‘鹰派’就要在庭审上把你折磨得够呛。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["斯捷尔诺娃","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"529812.png","audio":"613301255","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“我能做的，就是在委员会面前担保你的忠诚，并且派给你一个最不适合担当联络员的飞行女巫。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"72"